Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(desktop):=20=E2=8C=98B=20marks=20a=20sessi?=
 =?UTF-8?q?on=20blocked=20=E2=80=94=20grey=20stripe,=20skipped=20by=20?=
